"P2616640593" "The Bane Sidhes are the most unhappy of all the Cabal's sorceresses. Their fury at the Red Caps has manifested itself in the form of their mournful screams, which can cause even the most powerful heroes to cringe."
// DisplayNames :
"P3475104999" "Bane Sidhe"

